================================================================
Third-party assets and libraries
================================================================

The application bundles Lottie animations exported from the
"KawaiiEmoji" Telegram sticker pack. The original author is
unknown to the project. Attribution is surfaced in the in-app
Credits dialog (Settings -> About -> Credits) along with a contact
path so the original author can request removal or replacement.
The original sticker pack is available at:
https://t.me/addemoji/KawaiiEmoji

================================================================
Inspirations and references
================================================================

Some of the OTP-detection helper lists in
app/src/main/kotlin/com/midtano/otp/data/prefs/PrefsFilter.kt
(specifically DEFAULT_CLEANUP_PHRASES and DEFAULT_IGNORED_PHRASES)
were inspired by the corresponding constants in:

  * otphelper by jd1378 (https://github.com/jd1378/otphelper)
    Licensed under AGPL-3.0.

This project is licensed under the MIT License. The phrase
lists in question are short factual collections of strings
(domain regex, "card ending NNNN", brand-name false-positive
filters). If the original author of otphelper considers this an
unacceptable derivative work, please open an issue at
https://github.com/MidTano/otp-overlay/issues and the lists
will be rewritten from scratch or the project licence will be
revisited.

